00:48:27.750 --> 00:48:29.916
<i>of RCCP Online Security Forum.</i>

740
00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:31.750
I know you're listening.

741
00:48:31.833 --> 00:48:32.916
<i>Of course I'm listening, ma'am.</i>

742
00:48:33.000 --> 00:48:34.000
No, not you.

743
00:48:34.833 --> 00:48:35.833
Him.

744
00:48:36.708 --> 00:48:38.458
<i>Sorry, who?
I don't understand.</i>

745
00:48:38.541 --> 00:48:39.916
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

746
00:48:40.000 --> 00:48:43.250
<i>I just need your bank details
and I can get it all sorted.</i>

747
00:48:43.333 --> 00:48:45.125
I can do this, do you hear me?

748
00:48:45.208 --> 00:48:46.791
<i>What?</i>

749
00:48:46.875 --> 00:48:48.375
<i>Just give me a chance.</i>

750
00:48:48.458 --> 00:48:50.333
<i>This is your big chance, Miss Marten.</i>

751
00:48:50.416 --> 00:48:51.500
<i>You're gonna be rich.</i>

752
00:48:52.083 --> 00:48:54.125
Hello?

753
00:48:54.208 --> 00:48:55.500
Hello?

754
00:48:56.791 --> 00:48:59.500
Come on, come on, come on.

755
00:49:00.375 --> 00:49:02.625
Hello?

756
00:49:02.708 --> 00:49:03.750
It's over.

757
00:49:03.833 --> 00:49:05.041
No, no, no, no, no, no.

758
00:49:05.125 --> 00:49:07.291
I can still do this. I'll do anything.

759
00:49:07.375 --> 00:49:09.000
<i>- You broke the rules.</i>
- I had no choice.

760
00:49:09.083 --> 00:49:10.083
They stole my phone.

761
00:49:10.166 --> 00:49:11.708
You waved a gun around in public.

762
00:49:11.791 --> 00:49:14.291
And now the police
have a call out for you.

763
00:49:14.375 --> 00:49:15.458
You're useless to me now.

764
00:49:15.541 --> 00:49:17.666
I'm not useless. I can still do this.

765
00:49:18.541 --> 00:49:19.541
Please.

766
00:49:19.625 --> 00:49:22.375
No.
I'll have to handle it myself.

767
00:49:23.208 --> 00:49:25.416
<i>A lot of people are gonna die,</i>

768
00:49:25.500 --> 00:49:27.250
not just Noah.

769
00:49:27.333 --> 00:49:29.166
It's gonna be messy

770
00:49:29.250 --> 00:49:30.458
<i>and that's your fault.</i>

771
00:49:31.666 --> 00:49:34.666
<i>I'm never wrong,
but I was wrong about you.</i>

772
00:49:37.458 --> 00:49:39.083
No, listen.

773
00:49:47.750 --> 00:49:49.541
You were only wrong about one thing.

774
00:49:52.291 --> 00:49:54.708
It wasn't my mother who killed my father,

775
00:49:56.166 --> 00:49:57.458
it was me.

776
00:50:07.000 --> 00:50:08.375
Tell me.

777
00:50:12.583 --> 00:50:14.875
When my father was drunk,
he became an animal.

778
00:50:15.875 --> 00:50:17.750
The things he did...

779
00:50:19.250 --> 00:50:20.791
One night I came into the kitchen,

780
00:50:20.875 --> 00:50:22.833
and he was drinking milk from a carton.

781
00:50:27.125 --> 00:50:29.541
His fists were still wet with blood.

782
00:50:30.708 --> 00:50:32.333
<i>My mother's blood.</i>

783
00:50:34.541 --> 00:50:36.083
I aimed my target pistol at him

784
00:50:36.166 --> 00:50:37.500
and he wasn't even afraid.

785
00:50:39.541 --> 00:50:41.833
It's like he thought
nothing could hurt him.

786
00:50:46.916 --> 00:50:48.750
So he died surprised.

787
00:50:51.416 --> 00:50:54.250
I never told this to anyone. Only you.

788
00:51:03.625 --> 00:51:05.125
Thank you.

789
00:51:08.166 --> 00:51:12.125
<i>So your mother went to jail
so you could have a life.</i>

790
00:51:14.625 --> 00:51:15.625
Yes.

791
00:51:28.333 --> 00:51:30.166
Please give me another chance.

792
00:51:58.583 --> 00:52:00.041
<i>You have 15 minutes.</i>

793
00:52:00.750 --> 00:52:02.041
Thank you.

794
00:52:41.166 --> 00:52:43.166
<i>You should be able
to see the hotel now.</i>

795
00:52:44.958 --> 00:52:46.625
<i>You've got plenty of time.</i>

796
00:52:53.166 --> 00:52:54.958
Shit. Police on the bridge.

797
00:52:59.333 --> 00:53:00.833
The whole area is crawling.

798
00:53:00.916 --> 00:53:02.791
You have to go to Blackfriars Bridge.

799
00:53:07.583 --> 00:53:08.916
I'll never make it.

800
00:53:18.916 --> 00:53:21.000
Just stop the drip.

801
00:53:21.083 --> 00:53:22.791
We're in this together now.

802
00:53:22.875 --> 00:53:24.750
Yes, we're a team now,

803
00:53:24.833 --> 00:53:26.458
<i>but remember what your father said.</i>

804
00:53:27.458 --> 00:53:31.208
Fear is a stronger
motivator than love. Hmm?

805
00:53:32.083 --> 00:53:33.583
<i>Police coming from
the other direction too.</i>

806
00:53:33.666 --> 00:53:35.875
<i>Take a hard left down the stairs.</i>

807
00:53:50.083 --> 00:53:52.250
The police are on their way
to Blackfriars.

808
00:53:52.916 --> 00:53:54.500
<i>Gotta be quick, Maia.</i>

809
00:54:04.833 --> 00:54:07.625
-  One Alpha Five.
- No, no, no.

810
00:54:07.708 --> 00:54:08.958
<i>Head to the underpass
to your left.</i>

811
00:54:17.583 --> 00:54:19.750
Waterloo is the only bridge
that's still open.

812
00:54:21.500 --> 00:54:23.708
If you keep this pace, you can do it.

813
00:54:23.791 --> 00:54:26.083
It's half a mile
in the wrong direction.

814
00:54:26.166 --> 00:54:27.208
I can't do that.

815
00:54:27.291 --> 00:54:29.500
<i>- Use the fear, Maia.</i>
- Fuck you!

816
00:54:54.500 --> 00:54:56.041
<i>Police car coming towards you.</i>

817
00:55:18.666 --> 00:55:21.791
Hey, hey, hey! Stop, thief!

818
00:55:21.875 --> 00:55:23.666
- Stop!
-  <i>Up the steps.</i>

819
00:55:23.750 --> 00:55:25.375
<i>Take a left.</i>

820
00:55:37.416 --> 00:55:39.250
<i>Cross the street.</i>

821
00:55:39.333 --> 00:55:41.416
<i>Take the alleyway behind King's College.</i>

822
00:55:47.750 --> 00:55:49.791
Now go left on the Strand.

823
00:56:06.833 --> 00:56:08.916
More police around the next corner.

824
00:56:09.583 --> 00:56:12.125
There's a shortcut
that gets you onto the bridge.

825
00:56:13.500 --> 00:56:15.958
<i>Take a left now through Somerset House.</i>

826
00:56:54.208 --> 00:56:55.333
There's a single policeman

827
00:56:55.416 --> 00:56:56.708
coming towards you.

828
00:56:57.625 --> 00:56:59.083
Blend into the crowd.

829
00:57:02.541 --> 00:57:03.666
<i>Twenty metres.</i>

830
00:57:07.291 --> 00:57:08.583
<i>Fifteen metres.</i>

831
00:57:11.333 --> 00:57:13.083
<i>Ten metres.</i>

832
00:57:16.750 --> 00:57:18.041
<i>Five metres.</i>

833
00:57:20.125 --> 00:57:22.375
My God, he was so cute!

834
00:57:22.458 --> 00:57:25.166
Sorry, sorry.

835
00:57:26.500 --> 00:57:28.416
-  Control, suspect...
- No, no, no.

836
00:57:28.500 --> 00:57:30.583
She's got a gun!

837
00:57:30.666 --> 00:57:31.958
Come on, go!

838
00:57:32.041 --> 00:57:33.875
<i>...believed to be
armed with a black handgun...</i>

839
00:57:33.958 --> 00:57:35.000
Take your hand off that!

840
00:57:35.083 --> 00:57:37.208
<i>Suspect is Maia Marten.</i>

841
00:57:37.291 --> 00:57:39.625
Take it easy. Take it easy.

842
00:57:39.708 --> 00:57:41.916
-  <i>Take his radio.</i>
- I don't need your help.

843
00:57:42.833 --> 00:57:45.083
-  Please, ma'am.
- Get back! Get back!

844
00:57:45.166 --> 00:57:47.041
Get back!

845
00:57:47.125 --> 00:57:48.958
Please, drop the weapon.

846
00:57:49.041 --> 00:57:52.000
Give me your radio. On your knees now!

847
00:57:52.083 --> 00:57:54.375
I said, give me the radio.

848
00:58:00.250 --> 00:58:02.583
Multiple police cars
incoming, Maia.

849
00:58:02.666 --> 00:58:04.166
Armed units.

850
00:58:08.708 --> 00:58:10.083
<i>- You're trapped!</i>
-  Armed police!

851
00:58:10.166 --> 00:58:11.375
Armed police!

852
00:58:11.458 --> 00:58:13.666
-  Police, drop the weapon!
-  <i>It's over!</i>

853
00:58:18.375 --> 00:58:20.583
Failure to comply,
we will use lethal force!

854
00:58:22.250 --> 00:58:24.458
<i>I'm sorry that Noah's
gonna die without you.</i>

855
00:58:25.416 --> 00:58:27.250
No, that's not gonna happen.

856
00:58:28.458 --> 00:58:30.041
Ma'am. Let me help you.

857
00:58:30.125 --> 00:58:32.166
Shut the fuck up!

858
00:58:32.958 --> 00:58:34.458
Whatever trouble you're in,

859
00:58:34.541 --> 00:58:35.541
we can still fix it.

860
00:58:35.625 --> 00:58:37.916
Drop the weapon!
Put the gun down!

861
00:58:38.000 --> 00:58:39.041
<i>What are you doing?</i>

862
00:58:39.125 --> 00:58:41.083
I thought you knew everything.

863
00:58:49.583 --> 00:58:52.000
Maia? Maia?

864
00:58:58.541 --> 00:59:01.416
Maia!

865
00:59:10.083 --> 00:59:12.375
-  Jesus.
-  <i>Oh, my God!</i>

866
00:59:12.458 --> 00:59:15.833
-  <i>Holy shit!</i>
-  Maia!

867
00:59:20.083 --> 00:59:21.083
<i>Mummy!</i>

868
00:59:26.750 --> 00:59:27.833
<i>Are you here?</i>

869
00:59:35.458 --> 00:59:37.541
What the hell
are you doing up here?

870
00:59:43.250 --> 00:59:46.833
I need you to take me
to London Bridge, south side.

871
00:59:51.041 --> 00:59:52.750
But if you don't get me there
in six minutes,

872
00:59:52.833 --> 00:59:54.541
my son will be dead.

873
00:59:57.500 --> 01:00:01.958
<i>♪ My, my, my, Delilah ♪</i>

874
01:00:05.083 --> 01:00:09.708
<i>♪ Why, why, why, Delilah? ♪</i>

875
01:00:12.541 --> 01:00:14.500
<i>♪ So before ♪</i>

876
01:00:16.000 --> 01:00:18.583
<i>♪ They come
To break down the door ♪</i>

877
01:00:18.666 --> 01:00:19.833
I'll take her.

878
01:00:19.916 --> 01:00:21.458
<i>♪ Forgive me, Delilah ♪</i>

879
01:00:21.541 --> 01:00:24.208
<i>♪ I just couldn't take
Any more ♪</i>

880
01:00:24.291 --> 01:00:26.041
<i>As you can see,
security is already heavy</i>

881
01:00:26.125 --> 01:00:28.041
<i>here at the Old Bailey</i>

882
01:00:28.125 --> 01:00:31.041
<i>as the legal teams begin to arrive
for Tommy Boyd's murder trial.</i>

883
01:00:31.125 --> 01:00:32.875
<i>Tantalisingly, we're hearing reports</i>

884
01:00:32.958 --> 01:00:36.125
<i>of a surprise witness
inside Mr Boyd's organisation,</i>

885
01:00:36.208 --> 01:00:38.291
<i>whose testimony is said to be devastating</i>

886
01:00:38.375 --> 01:00:40.083
<i>for the alleged criminal kingpin.</i>

887
01:00:40.166 --> 01:00:42.333
<i>Back to you, Mike, for the weather.</i>

888
01:00:42.416 --> 01:00:43.750
See the <i>HMS Belfast</i> up ahead?

889
01:00:45.208 --> 01:00:47.666
I can get us near enough
for you to jump onto the jetty

890
01:00:47.750 --> 01:00:49.125
but I can't stop.

891
01:00:50.666 --> 01:00:52.250
Can you do that?

892
01:00:53.625 --> 01:00:56.041
- Take the starboard door.
- Thank you.

893
01:00:57.666 --> 01:01:01.250
I broke your special rules,
your stupid freaking rules.

894
01:01:01.333 --> 01:01:03.125
<i>Rules are made to be broken.</i>

895
01:01:03.958 --> 01:01:06.208
<i>This is the end game.</i>

896
01:01:26.500 --> 01:01:28.750
...Belfast, beautiful day for it.

897
01:01:28.833 --> 01:01:31.125
It's a pride...

898
01:02:06.375 --> 01:02:09.333
They're here, the security detail,

899
01:02:09.416 --> 01:02:11.083
getting ready to move him.

900
01:02:11.166 --> 01:02:13.458
<i>No time to waste, then.</i>

901
01:02:13.541 --> 01:02:15.250
<i>Noah's breathing is getting shallow.</i>

902
01:02:26.625 --> 01:02:27.708
I got this. Okay.

903
01:02:50.625 --> 01:02:52.291
You're here, aren't you?

904
01:02:57.291 --> 01:03:00.458
<i>There are 267 rooms
in this establishment.</i>

905
01:03:03.958 --> 01:03:06.541
<i>Could you find a Noah in the haystack?</i>

906
01:03:08.541 --> 01:03:11.541
<i>Do your job, then you'll get
the room number.</i>

907
01:03:12.208 --> 01:03:15.875
Er, excuse me, madam,
may I ask where you're going?

908
01:03:16.916 --> 01:03:20.125
I'm visiting a client,
Imperial Suite, 53rd floor.

909
01:03:23.416 --> 01:03:24.541
Just one moment, please.

910
01:03:24.625 --> 01:03:25.625
No, no, no, no.

911
01:03:26.833 --> 01:03:29.333
Listen, listen, listen, sir,
I don't have time for this.

912
01:03:29.416 --> 01:03:31.291
- I have a Ms...
- I don't have time for this.

913
01:03:31.375 --> 01:03:32.375
I need to go upstairs, please.

914
01:03:32.458 --> 01:03:33.500
- What's your name, please?
- Maia Marten.

915
01:03:33.583 --> 01:03:35.750
- It's an emergency.
- Maia Marten.

916
01:03:41.041 --> 01:03:42.333
- Yes, okay.
- Sir.

917
01:03:42.416 --> 01:03:43.416
That's fine.

918
01:03:45.041 --> 01:03:46.500
You can go up now, Ms Marten.

919
01:03:47.541 --> 01:03:49.083
Have a good day, madam.

920
01:03:54.208 --> 01:03:55.958
<i>Check the gun.</i>

921
01:04:02.583 --> 01:04:04.375
<i>Open your phone so I can see you.</i>

922
01:04:09.375 --> 01:04:11.458
<i>A little reminder of what's at stake.</i>

923
01:04:17.000 --> 01:04:19.333
Now put it back on your arm,
facing forward.

924
01:04:22.000 --> 01:04:24.583
<i>I need to see you do this
with my own eyes.</i>

925
01:05:06.958 --> 01:05:08.750
- Morning.
-  Good morning, ma'am.

926
01:05:08.833 --> 01:05:11.500
I need to have a last-minute
chat with my client.

927
01:05:11.583 --> 01:05:13.833
Been for a run, ma'am?

928
01:05:13.916 --> 01:05:15.458
Have I ever.

929
01:05:17.458 --> 01:05:19.416
You should get that cut seen to, ma'am.

930
01:05:19.500 --> 01:05:21.000
<i>It was a really
difficult chance,</i>

931
01:05:21.083 --> 01:05:22.708
<i>diving forward.</i>

932
01:05:23.666 --> 01:05:25.875
<i>He just couldn't quite get
his fingers under the ball.</i>

933
01:05:26.416 --> 01:05:28.791
<i>He did well to stop it, to be fair.</i>

934
01:05:43.333 --> 01:05:45.500
Come in.

935
01:05:46.750 --> 01:05:48.416
Hello, Maia.

936
01:05:48.500 --> 01:05:50.500
Do you like my new suit?

937
01:05:51.333 --> 01:05:53.166
I got it for the big day.

938
01:05:55.666 --> 01:05:57.125
You look like shit.

939
01:05:59.625 --> 01:06:00.916
Maia?

940
01:06:01.000 --> 01:06:02.500
Wait, wait. What you doing?

941
01:06:16.625 --> 01:06:19.291
What's going on?
Ma'am, open the door!

942
01:06:19.375 --> 01:06:21.166
{\an8}

943
01:06:59.833 --> 01:07:00.875
Let me through! Out of my way!

944
01:07:00.958 --> 01:07:02.791
Let me through!

945
01:07:02.875 --> 01:07:04.041
Come on, darling, let's go!

946
01:07:05.458 --> 01:07:06.916
- Come on.
- Out of my way! Out of my way!

947
01:07:32.791 --> 01:07:34.791
Oh, my God. Oh, my God.

948
01:07:34.875 --> 01:07:37.083
Okay, Noah, wake up!

949
01:07:37.166 --> 01:07:38.791
Mummy's here. Wake up.

950
01:07:39.958 --> 01:07:42.208
Noah, wake up!

951
01:07:50.750 --> 01:07:53.000
Noah. Noah.

952
01:07:54.041 --> 01:07:56.500
Noah! Come on. Wake up.

953
01:07:56.583 --> 01:07:58.500
Noah, come on!

954
01:08:00.541 --> 01:08:03.541
Noah, monkey, please don't leave me.

955
01:08:03.625 --> 01:08:05.041
Come back!

956
01:08:11.000 --> 01:08:12.291
Wake up, baby.

957
01:08:29.333 --> 01:08:31.250
Mummy.

958
01:08:37.041 --> 01:08:38.500
Hey, baby.

959
01:08:39.333 --> 01:08:41.791
Mum, I'm thirsty.

960
01:08:47.375 --> 01:08:48.916
I'll get you anything.

961
01:08:49.000 --> 01:08:50.666
I'll get you anything.

962
01:08:50.750 --> 01:08:52.416
I'm so sorry.

963
01:08:53.041 --> 01:08:55.000
I love you so much.

964
01:09:06.916 --> 01:09:08.291
Move back, sir!

965
01:09:11.958 --> 01:09:12.958
Do you know what's happening?

966
01:09:13.041 --> 01:09:14.125
I don't know.

967
01:09:24.125 --> 01:09:25.666
Ms Marten.

968
01:09:25.750 --> 01:09:26.750
DCI Philips.

969
01:09:28.291 --> 01:09:30.000
He's still here, isn't he?

970
01:09:31.458 --> 01:09:33.125
The building's locked down.

971
01:09:33.208 --> 01:09:35.291
Only emergency services
are allowed in and out.

972
01:09:38.583 --> 01:09:40.333
We're hoping the boy can identify him.

973
01:09:40.416 --> 01:09:42.208
He doesn't remember anything.

974
01:09:43.208 --> 01:09:44.666
<i>Killer.</i>

975
01:09:47.791 --> 01:09:50.250
- Maia? Maia?
-  Sir, sir, stop!

976
01:09:51.666 --> 01:09:52.666
Can I please...

977
01:09:52.750 --> 01:09:55.375
Can I please just talk to them?

978
01:09:55.458 --> 01:09:58.583
Sir, I have to ask you to
step away from the suspects.

979
01:10:00.291 --> 01:10:01.791
Noah,

980
01:10:02.416 --> 01:10:04.875
this is Ted, my friend.

981
01:10:06.333 --> 01:10:07.625
You're a brave boy.

982
01:10:11.541 --> 01:10:14.125
There's something else. Ted, would you...

983
01:10:15.000 --> 01:10:17.666
Of course. We'll get you
checked out by a paramedic.

984
01:10:18.833 --> 01:10:20.041
Mum.

985
01:10:20.125 --> 01:10:22.333
It's okay. I'll just be a few minutes.

986
01:10:23.000 --> 01:10:24.000
You all right?

987
01:10:24.083 --> 01:10:25.500
-  Yeah, I'm fine.
-  Okay.

988
01:10:31.125 --> 01:10:33.083
He said he has a contingency plan,

989
01:10:34.333 --> 01:10:35.625
